# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The deep desert

step The Broken Pillar
  tip Ride south to the dig camp at the Broken Pillar. Marvon hands you a detector helm: wear it to see the Gahz'ridian mounds, which lie thick in the sand around the camp and south-west toward the ogres.
  accept 3161                         -- Marvon Rivetseeker
  collect 8443 quest 3161             -- Gahz'ridian Ornament
  turnin 3161

step Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail
  collect 6257 quest 1452.1 @43.5,40.6 map 1446

step The Noxious Lair
  tip Ride north-west to the Centipaar hive in the dunes. Any Centipaar can drop insect parts.
  tip Careful: Centipaar Swarmers cast Silithid Swarm both in and out of combat, which brings small adds that interrupt you.
  collect 8587 quest 82               -- Centipaar Insect Parts

step Dunemaul Compound
  tip Ride south-west to the ogre compound. Brutes and Enforcers (46-48) fill it; Gor'marok the Ravager (49) stands in the middle with guards around him: clear them first.
  kill 5474 quest 5863                -- Dunemaul Brute
  kill 5472 quest 5863                -- Dunemaul Enforcer
  kill 12046 x1 quest 5863            -- Gor'marok the Ravager, below ground
  level 47.06 grind 5474               -- grind on Dunemaul Brute

step Thistleshrub Valley: kill these as you meet them
  zone Tanaris
  tip Ride south into Thistleshrub Valley. The Dew Collectors drop the glands; only some are full, so keep the Laden one. Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers share the valley. The Thistleshrubs are 48-50, above you: pull one at a time.
  tip Careful: The other thistleshrub mobs in the area are level 49-50 and wander a lot, so you can easily pull extra mobs.
  collect 8428 x1 quest 2605          -- Laden Dew Gland
  kill 5485 quest 3362                -- Thistleshrub Rootshaper
  kill 5490 quest 3362                -- Gnarled Thistleshrub

step Tooga's escort
  tip The little turtle Tooga hides at the north end of the valley. Lead him home to his wife Torta, by the water just east of Steamwheedle Port: he walks slowly and the desert's beasts go for him, so keep him alive.
  accept 1560                         -- Tooga
  complete 1560
  turnin 1560                         -- Torta

step Gadgetzan
  tip Ride back west to Gadgetzan: Andi Lynn stands on the east side of town, where you come in.
  turnin 5863                         -- Andi Lynn
  turnin 2605                         -- Marin Noggenfogger
  accept 2606
  turnin 3362                         -- Tran'rek
  turnin 2606                         -- Sprinkle
  accept 2641
  turnin 82                           -- Alchemist Pestlezugg, inside
  accept 10                           -- Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south

step Caliph Scorpidsting
  tip Ride south-east to Waterspring Field. Caliph stands in the middle of the southern Wastewander camp: clear around him first.
  tip Careful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them.
  collect 8723 x1 quest 2781          -- Caliph Scorpidsting's Head

step The Gaping Chasm
  tip Ride south past the Broken Pillar to the Gaping Chasm, the Hazzali tunnels; Scrimshank's gear lies deep inside.
  tip Careful: One bug guards the gear. Many bugs patrol the tunnels, some of them level 50, so fights often pull extra adds.
  collect 8593 x1 quest 10            -- Scrimshank's Surveying Gear; below ground

